/*
The following points is the essential steps to process feedback file:
1)start a seperate feedback rewriting thread
2)try locking the feedback file's lock file until writing it.
3)if locked successfully,write the feedback file and then unlock the feedback lock.
4)if failed to lock,write the feedback_json_processid temporarily,and just go on related execution flow.
5)inside feedback thread,check whether feedback related temporary file exits.if some file has been found,
  make some functional check,for example whether the data is not obsolete.if data is ok,update the feedback.
6)meta data for feedback file,mainly including:job status,percent,msg is less important.
*/

